  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.13.1:\n      - Adds compile-checked host compatibility samples for console, worker, class library, test project, and shared contracts/client layouts.\n      - Adds a compile-checked migration cookbook sample for mediator and mapper upgrade flows.\n      - Documents package deprecation and versioned documentation strategy for release governance.\n      - Updates compatibility gates to compare against the 1.13.0 published line.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
